 on his head…!? Watch the dogs and cats from Third Street take on a human form and get up to some mischief.\n\nTake a peek into the wonderful lives of Tama and his friends.\n\n(Source: Aniplex of America)"},"tags":[{"name":"Animals","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nekomimi","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Boys Doing Cute Things","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Iyashikei","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":64,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Uchitama?! Have you seen my Tama?","english":"Uchitama?! Have you seen my Tama?","native":"うちタマ?!~うちのタマ知りませんか?~","romaji":"Uchitama?! Uchi no Tama Shirimasen ka?","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"うちタマ?! ～うちのタマ知りませんか？～"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"UCHITAMA?!～猫狗宠物街～"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"家有圆圆？！～我家的圆圆你知道吗～"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"家有圆圆⁈ ～我家的圆圆你知道吗？～"}]},"trailer":{"id":"m_NohQsb3Gs","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m_NohQsb3Gs/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}